## Success Metrics

### Minimum Viable Product (MVP)
- ✅ Baseline validated (r≈0.88)
- ✅ Works on 4+ metapaths
- ✅ Documented limitations
- ✅ Beats all baselines

### Target Success
- ✅ Feature ablation improves to r≥0.90
- ✅ 6/8 metapaths achieve r≥0.85
- ✅ 3-hop paths work (r≥0.85)
- ✅ Novel biological findings

### Stretch Goals
- ✅ r≥0.95 achieved
- ✅ 8/8 metapaths succeed
- ✅ 5-hop paths work
- ✅ 10+ validated drug repurposing candidates

