- **GPU**: Not required (small models, fast training)
- **RAM**: 64GB sufficient for most metapaths
- **Time**: ~100 CPU-hours per metapath (full pipeline)

### Data
- **Permutations 1-30**: Already downloaded
- **Hetionet v1.0**: Available
- **Storage**: ~50GB for all data and results

